{"unit_id": "tag:07ZR:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra），由<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上生成（generated）。令<MATH_0006>。在这种情形下，<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>上可逆（invertible）且极丰沛（very ample）。确切地说，与分次（graded）<MATH_0009>-代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0010>相应的态射（morphism）是闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0011>，它把<MATH_0012>拉回（pulls back）为<MATH_0013>。见 Constructions 中的引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": ["Constructions"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "极丰沛"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "pulls back", "target_term": "拉回"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指定第一个对象所属的类别。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定分次代数的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰由所给对象生成的代数。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指相对于所给底层对象的代数。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "表述该代数在底层对象上的生成关系。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "表述该对象在指定概形上的可逆性质。"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "极丰沛", "context": "表述该对象在指定概形上的极丰沛性质。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰诱导该态射的代数映射。"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射", "context": "指诱导几何态射的代数映射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指由该分次代数映射诱导的态射。"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入",