{"unit_id": "tag:01VO:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为域（field）。考虑分次（graded）<MATH_0002>-代数（algebra）\n<MATHSEG_0001>其中<MATHSEG_0002>\n其分次（grading）由<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>给出。注意到<MATH_0005>由<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>覆盖（covered）。因此，各层（sheaves）<MATH_0008>均可逆（invertible），且均与<MATH_0009>同构（isomorphic）。特别地，<MATH_0010>是丰沛（ample）的，并且是关于<MATH_0011>的丰沛（ample）的，这里所考虑的是态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>。我们断言，<MATH_0013>的任何幂（power）都不是<MATH_0014>-相对极丰沛（relatively very ample）的。确切地说，容易看出<MATH_0015>是次数（degree）为<MATH_0016>的直和项（summand），属于代数（algebra）<MATH_0017>。因此，若<MATH_0018>是极丰沛（very ample）的，则<MATH_0019>将作为闭子概形（closed subscheme）包含于<MATH_0020>上的一个射影（projective）空间，因而在<MATH_0021>上是有限型（finite type）的。另一方面，<MATH_0022>是<MATH_0023>的谱（spectrum），而后者在<MATH_0024>上不是有限型（finite type）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "grading", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "covered", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "power", "target_term": "幂"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对极丰沛"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "summand", "target_term": "直和项"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "very ample", "target_term": "极丰沛"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "指